00:58:04.315 --> 00:58:05.783
Hmm?

00:58:06.985 --> 00:58:09.158
Kau tak mencintaiku lagi...

00:58:12.532 --> 00:58:14.284
Kau satu-satunya.

00:58:16.119 --> 00:58:17.837
Aku satu-satunya bagimu.

